  "worked_solution": "Substituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ directly into the limit, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\,\\pi /4}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\,\\pi /4}5sin\u2061(2x) \\\\  & =5sin\u2061(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =5\\cdot sin\u2061(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =5\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
